        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo 1457-628, Plunger Door Holder</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPlunger type door holder mounts to the lower surface of the door to keep it in an open position when activated. Just push the plunger down with your foot to activate then press the release tab to inactivate. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/don-jo-1457-628_size.gif?v=1704354746\" width=\"600\" height=\"300\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo 1457-628 Plunger Door Holder Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nIt includes a non-skid rubber tip to protect the floor and  supplied with #8 x 1\" sheet metal screws. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Don-Jo 1457-628 Plunger Door Holder:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Height: 6-3/16\" </li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection Off Door: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Throw: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Door Gap to Floor: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Cast Aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Satin Aluminum</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/1457-628.pdf?v=1704262301\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo 1457 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually.</b>\r\n</p>",
